---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import {
  Database,
  Cpu,
  Zap,
  Shield,
  Rocket,
  RefreshCcw,
  CheckCircle2,
  Terminal,
  ArrowRight,
  Lock,
  Layers,
  Sparkles,
  FileCheck
} from 'lucide-react';

const title = 'MoroAI Architecture & Features — Deep Technical Breakdown';
const description = 'Explore the 6 core systems behind MoroAI: Epistemic Data Compiler, Hardware Recipe Engine, Self-Healing Training, Multi-Layered Eval, Cryptographic Release, and DPO Flywheel.';
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <main class="pt-32 pb-24">
    {/* Page Header */}
    <div className="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center mb-24">
      <div className="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-moro-500/10 border border-moro-500/20 text-moro-400 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-6">
        <Sparkles className="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
        <span>In-Depth Engineering</span>
      </div>
      <h1 className="text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-black text-white tracking-tight mb-6">
        Under the Hood of <span className="bg-gradient-to-r from-moro-400 via-sky-300 to-purple-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">MoroAI</span>
      </h1>
      <p className="text-lg sm:text-xl text-gray-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        A deep architectural breakdown of how MoroAI turns uncurated enterprise data into
        production-grade, private local language models without cloud dependencies.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div className="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-28">
      {/* 1. Epistemic Data Compiler */}
      <section id="data-compiler" className="scroll-mt-32">
        <div className="rounded-3xl border border-dark-800 bg-dark-900/60 p-8 sm:p-12 relative overflow-hidden backdrop-blur-xl">
          <div className="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-6">
            <div className="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500 to-cyan-500 flex items-center justify-center text-white shadow-lg">
              <Database className="w-6 h-6" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <span className="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Subsystem 01</span>
              <h2 className="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white">Epistemic Data Compiler & MI Guard</h2>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div className="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start">
            <div className="lg:col-span-7 space-y-4 text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
              <p>
                Standard LLM fine-tuning datasets frequently suffer from semantic redundancy and the unintended loss of critical domain outliers. When organizations run standard deduplication, high-frequency generic patterns survive while rare business rules and corner cases are pruned away.
              </p>
              <p>
                MoroAI introduces the <strong class="text-white">Mutual Information (MI) Guard</strong>. It calculates Shannon entropy and embedding divergence across the dataset. Samples that contain high information gain relative to the core distribution are cryptographically tagged and protected from deduplication pruning.
              </p>
              <div className="pt-2">
                <h4 className="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-mono text-gray-400 font-semibold mb-3">Key Capabilities</h4>
                <div className="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-xs">
                  <div className="flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-200 bg-dark-950/80 p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-dark-800">
                    <CheckCircle2 className="w-4 h-4 text-cyan-400 shrink-0" />
                    <span>Information-theoretic token density</span>
                  </div>
                  <div className="flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-200 bg-dark-950/80 p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-dark-800">
                    <CheckCircle2 className="w-4 h-4 text-cyan-400 shrink-0" />
                    <span>Cosine + Jaccard semantic clustering</span>
                  </div>
                  <div className="flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-200 bg-dark-950/80 p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-dark-800">
                    <CheckCircle2 className="w-4 h-4 text-cyan-400 shrink-0" />
                    <span>Automated train/val/test splits</span>
                  </div>
                  <div className="flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-200 bg-dark-950/80 p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-dark-800">
                    <CheckCircle2 className="w-4 h-4 text-cyan-400 shrink-0" />
                    <span>Cryptographic dataset SHA-256 fingerprint</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div className="lg:col-span-5 bg-dark-950 rounded-2xl border border-dark-800 p-5 font-mono text-xs">
              <div className="text-gray-400 border-b border-dark-800 pb-2 mb-3 flex items-center justify-between">
                <span>CLI Invocation</span>
                <span className="text-cyan-400">moro data build</span>
              </div>
              <pre className="text-sky-300 overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre-wrap leading-relaxed">
{`$ moro data build \\
    --source ./customer_ops.jsonl \\
    --mi-guard-threshold 0.85 \\
    --dedup-threshold 0.88 \\
    --output ./data/curated.jsonl

[INFO] Total raw inputs: 10,480
[MI-GUARD] Protected 312 critical edge cases
[DEDUP] Pruned 2,890 redundant instances
[DONE] Final curated: 7,590 samples
[ENTROPY] +28.4% mean token information`}
              </pre>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      {/* 2. Hardware-Aware Recipe Engine */}
      <section id="recipe-engine" className="scroll-mt-32">
        <div className="rounded-3xl border border-dark-800 bg-dark-900/60 p-8 sm:p-12 relative overflow-hidden backdrop-blur-xl">
          <div className="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-6">
            <div className="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500 to-teal-500 flex items-center justify-center text-white shadow-lg">
              <Cpu className="w-6 h-6" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <span className="text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Subsystem 02</span>
              <h2 className="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white">Hardware-Aware Recipe Engine</h2>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div className="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start">
            <div className="lg:col-span-7 space-y-4 text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
              <p>
                Fine-tuning typically involves hours of trial and error guessing hyperparameter values, micro-batch sizes, and gradient accumulation steps before crashing halfway through with an Out Of Memory (OOM) error.
              </p>
              <p>
                MoroAI performs <strong class="text-white">Pre-Flight VRAM Auditing</strong>. By inspecting GPU architecture (VRAM capacity, compute capability, tensor cores), model weight tensors, and sequence length, it predicts exact peak memory usage and configures the optimal LoRA rank (r), alpha, and quantization (NF4/FP16) guaranteed to stay within hardware limits.
              </p>
              <div className="pt-2">
                <h4 className="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-mono text-gray-400 font-semibold mb-3">Key Capabilities</h4>
                <div className="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-xs">
                  <div className="flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-200 bg-dark-950/80 p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-dark-800">
                    <CheckCircle2 className="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 shrink-0" />
                    <span>CUDA & Apple Silicon Metal detection</span>
                  </div>
                  <div className="flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-200 bg-dark-950/80 p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-dark-800">
                    <CheckCircle2 className="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 shrink-0" />
                    <span>Activation tensor size calculation</span>
                  </div>
                  <div className="flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-200 bg-dark-950/80 p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-dark-800">
                    <CheckCircle2 className="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 shrink-0" />
                    <span>Auto-tuned batch & accumulation</span>
                  </div>
                  <div className="flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-200 bg-dark-950/80 p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-dark-800">
                    <CheckCircle2 className="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 shrink-0" />
                    <span>Export to reproducible moro.yaml</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div className="lg:col-span-5 bg-dark-950 rounded-2xl border border-dark-800 p-5 font-mono text-xs">
              <div className="text-gray-400 border-b border-dark-800 pb-2 mb-3 flex items-center justify-between">
                <span>VRAM Simulator</span>
                <span className="text-emerald-400">moro recipe generate</span>
              </div>
              <pre className="text-emerald-300 overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre-wrap leading-relaxed">
{`$ moro recipe generate --model Qwen2.5-1.5B

Device: NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 (12,288 MB)
Model Weights (4-bit NF4):    ~1,240 MB
Optimizer States (AdamW 8b):   ~450 MB
Activation Peak (Seq 2048):    ~5,120 MB
CUDA Context & Buffers:        ~1,040 MB
-----------------------------------------
Predicted Peak VRAM:           ~7,850 MB
Safe Available Headroom:       ~4,438 MB (36%)

Recipe generated: ./moro.yaml (Verified Zero OOM)`}
              </pre>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      {/* 3. Self-Healing Training Engine */}
      <section id="training-engine" className="scroll-mt-32">
        <div className="rounded-3xl border border-dark-800 bg-dark-900/60 p-8 sm:p-12 relative overflow-hidden backdrop-blur-xl">
          <div className="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-6">
            <div className="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500 to-pink-500 flex items-center justify-center text-white shadow-lg">
              <Zap className="w-6 h-6" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <span className="text-xs font-mono text-purple-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Subsystem 03</span>
              <h2 className="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white">Self-Healing Training Engine</h2>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div className="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start">
            <div className="lg:col-span-7 space-y-4 text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
              <p>
                Unattended training runs fail for two primary reasons: sudden CUDA Out-of-Memory spikes triggered by long outlier tokens, or training loss explosion caused by numerical instability.
              </p>
              <p>
                MoroAI wraps the execution loop in an <strong class="text-white">Autonomous 5-Step Healer</strong>:
              </p>
              <ol className="list-decimal list-inside space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm pl-2 text-gray-300">
                <li><strong class="text-purple-300">Level 1:</strong> Intercept CUDA OOM exception & flush driver cache.</li>
                <li><strong class="text-purple-300">Level 2:</strong> Halve micro-batch size and double gradient accumulation.</li>
                <li><strong class="text-purple-300">Level 3:</strong> Enforce gradient checkpointing on remaining attention layers.</li>
                <li><strong class="text-purple-300">Level 4:</strong> Dynamic sequence truncation on spike batches.</li>
                <li><strong class="text-purple-300">Level 5:</strong> Auto-revert to the last stable checkpoint if loss diverges &gt; 3x.</li>
              </ol>
            </div>

            <div className="lg:col-span-5 bg-dark-950 rounded-2xl border border-dark-800 p-5 font-mono text-xs">
              <div className="text-gray-400 border-b border-dark-800 pb-2 mb-3 flex items-center justify-between">
                <span>Autonomous Recovery</span>
                <span className="text-purple-400">moro train --auto-heal</span>
              </div>
              <pre className="text-purple-300 overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre-wrap leading-relaxed">
{`Step 420/1200 | Loss: 1.12 | VRAM: 7.9GB
[WARN] CUDA OOM at step 421 (token length 3,840)
[HEAL] Level 1: Flushed CUDA memory pool
[HEAL] Level 2: Micro-batch 2 -> 1, Accum 8 -> 16
[RESUME] Checkpoint 400 reloaded
Step 421/1200 | Loss: 1.11 | VRAM: 6.1GB (STABLE)
Step 422/1200 | Loss: 1.09 | VRAM: 6.2GB
[SUCCESS] Full training finished with 0 data loss`}
              </pre>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      {/* 4. Multi-Layered Eval Harness */}
      <section id="eval-harness" className="scroll-mt-32">
        <div className="rounded-3xl border border-dark-800 bg-dark-900/60 p-8 sm:p-12 relative overflow-hidden backdrop-blur-xl">
          <div className="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-6">
            <div className="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-red-500 to-orange-500 flex items-center justify-center text-white shadow-lg">
              <Shield className="w-6 h-6" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <span className="text-xs font-mono text-red-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Subsystem 04</span>
              <h2 className="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white">Multi-Layered Evaluation Harness</h2>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div className="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start">
            <div className="lg:col-span-7 space-y-4 text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
              <p>
                Evaluation cannot rely solely on validation loss. A lower loss does not guarantee that a model won't hallucinate or violate deterministic enterprise requirements.
              </p>
              <p>
                MoroAI runs four distinct evaluation barriers before certifying a model for deployment:
              </p>
              <ul className="space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-300">
                <li className="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span className="text-red-400 font-bold">•</span>
                  <span><strong>Deterministic Regex & JSON Gates:</strong> Validates structured schema adherence and strict business logic rules.</span>
                </li>
                <li className="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span className="text-red-400 font-bold">•</span>
                  <span><strong>Semantic LLM Judge:</strong> Compares completions against domain ground truth.</span>
                </li>
                <li className="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span className="text-red-400 font-bold">•</span>
                  <span><strong>Wasserstein Drift Detection:</strong> Quantifies output embedding divergence against reference standards.</span>
                </li>
                <li className="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span className="text-red-400 font-bold">•</span>
                  <span><strong>Adversarial Perturbations:</strong> Injects synthetic typos and syntactic swaps to verify invariance.</span>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div className="lg:col-span-5 bg-dark-950 rounded-2xl border border-dark-800 p-5 font-mono text-xs">
              <div className="text-gray-400 border-b border-dark-800 pb-2 mb-3 flex items-center justify-between">
                <span>Evaluation Gate</span>
                <span className="text-red-400">moro eval compare</span>
              </div>
              <pre className="text-orange-300 overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre-wrap leading-relaxed">
{`Eval Suite: Enterprise Support v1 (150 tests)
-----------------------------------------------
1. Deterministic Format Rules:  100.0%  (PASS)
2. Semantic Domain Accuracy:     94.2%  (PASS)
3. Wasserstein Drift Score:      0.024  (PASS <0.05)
4. Adversarial Typo Stress:      91.8%  (PASS >90%)
-----------------------------------------------
OVERALL VERDICT: QUALIFIED FOR PRODUCTION
Release Gate ID: gate_78f1a9e3`}
              </pre>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      {/* 5. Release Governance & Cryptographic Provenance */}
      <section id="governance" className="scroll-mt-32">
        <div className="rounded-3xl border border-dark-800 bg-dark-900/60 p-8 sm:p-12 relative overflow-hidden backdrop-blur-xl">
          <div className="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-6">
            <div className="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-teal-500 to-emerald-500 flex items-center justify-center text-white shadow-lg">
              <FileCheck className="w-6 h-6" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <span className="text-xs font-mono text-teal-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Subsystem 05</span>
              <h2 className="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white">Cryptographic Release Governance (SBOM)</h2>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div className="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start">
            <div className="lg:col-span-7 space-y-4 text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
              <p>
                In high-compliance sectors (finance, healthcare, defense), deploying an AI model without strict provenance is a regulatory liability. MoroAI automatically creates an immutable <strong>Software Bill of Materials (SBOM)</strong> for every release candidate.
              </p>
              <p>
                Every release bundle cryptographically binds:
              </p>
              <div className="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs">
                <div className="bg-dark-950 p-3 rounded-lg border border-dark-800">
                  <span className="text-teal-400 font-mono font-bold block mb-1">Dataset Hash</span>
                  <span className="text-gray-400">SHA-256 fingerprint of the exact compiled training data</span>
                </div>
                <div className="bg-dark-950 p-3 rounded-lg border border-dark-800">
                  <span className="text-teal-400 font-mono font-bold block mb-1">Recipe Snapshot</span>
                  <span className="text-gray-400">Deterministic seed, learning rate, and rank configuration</span>
                </div>
                <div className="bg-dark-950 p-3 rounded-lg border border-dark-800">
                  <span className="text-teal-400 font-mono font-bold block mb-1">Eval Certificate</span>
                  <span className="text-gray-400">Signed benchmark results and passing gate scores</span>
                </div>
                <div className="bg-dark-950 p-3 rounded-lg border border-dark-800">
                  <span className="text-teal-400 font-mono font-bold block mb-1">Weights Signature</span>
                  <span className="text-gray-400">Final adapter and GGUF quant checksums</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div className="lg:col-span-5 bg-dark-950 rounded-2xl border border-dark-800 p-5 font-mono text-xs">
              <div className="text-gray-400 border-b border-dark-800 pb-2 mb-3 flex items-center justify-between">
                <span>Release Manifest</span>
                <span className="text-teal-400">moro release verify</span>
              </div>
              <pre className="text-teal-300 overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre-wrap leading-relaxed">
{`{
  "release_id": "rel_2026_09_28_01",
  "base_model": "Qwen/Qwen2.5-1.5B",
  "dataset_sha256": "8f3b20...a19c",
  "recipe_sha256": "44ea10...e7b2",
  "gate_passed": true,
  "eval_score": 0.942,
  "quantization": "Q4_K_M",
  "provenance_sig": "sig_rsa4096_d892a01",
  "status": "APPROVED_FOR_DEPLOY"
}`}
              </pre>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      {/* 6. DPO Feedback Flywheel */}
      <section id="flywheel" className="scroll-mt-32">
        <div className="rounded-3xl border border-dark-800 bg-dark-900/60 p-8 sm:p-12 relative overflow-hidden backdrop-blur-xl">
          <div className="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-6">
            <div className="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500 to-yellow-500 flex items-center justify-center text-white shadow-lg">
              <RefreshCcw className="w-6 h-6" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <span className="text-xs font-mono text-amber-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Subsystem 06</span>
              <h2 className="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white">Closed-Loop DPO Feedback Flywheel</h2>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div className="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start">
            <div className="lg:col-span-7 space-y-4 text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
              <p>
                A deployed model shouldn't remain static. As users interact with your private AI, operators correct outputs, thumbs-up good completions, or provide manual revisions.
              </p>
              <p>
                The MoroAI Flywheel automatically ingests these production corrections and formats them into <strong>Direct Preference Optimization (DPO) preference pairs (prompt, chosen, rejected)</strong>. When enough preference data accumulates, MoroAI triggers a local DPO alignment round to fine-tune the model against its real-world mistakes.
              </p>
              <div className="pt-2">
                <a
                  href="/docs/getting-started/quickstart/"
                  className="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300 border border-amber-500/30 hover:bg-amber-500/30 text-sm font-semibold transition-colors"
                >
                  <span>Build Your First Local Model</span>
                  <ArrowRight className="w-4 h-4" />
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div className="lg:col-span-5 bg-dark-950 rounded-2xl border border-dark-800 p-5 font-mono text-xs">
              <div className="text-gray-400 border-b border-dark-800 pb-2 mb-3 flex items-center justify-between">
                <span>DPO Miner</span>
                <span className="text-amber-400">moro flywheel process</span>
              </div>
              <pre className="text-amber-300 overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre-wrap leading-relaxed">
{`$ moro flywheel process \\
    --interactions ./logs/chat_ops.jsonl \\
    --min-margin 0.3

[SCAN] Ingested 1,200 production sessions
[PAIR] Extracted 342 chosen/rejected pairs
[FILTER] Discarded 48 ambiguous feedback events
[READY] DPO dataset created: ./dpo_v2.jsonl
[TRIGGER] Scheduled offline alignment run`}
              </pre>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
